<title>JAPAN: Toyota exports up 22.2 pct in June yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Toyota exports up 22.2 pct in June yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp said on Friday that its exports rose 22.2 percent in June from a year earlier to 140,128 vehicles.</p>
<p>Its exports in the first six months of calendar 1997 rose 12.4 percent from a year earlier to 703,458 vehicles.  </p>
<p>Vehicle exports rose for the third successive month due to higher exports to Europe, Latin America and Oceania.</p>
<p>But its exports to the United States in June fell 0.3 percent to 40,791 units, a Toyota spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Toyota's domestic vehicle production rose 10.5 percent in June from a year earlier to 306,232 vehicles, rising for a fourth straight month on a year-on-year basis.</p>
<p>Its domestic sales fell in June for the third successive month. Toyota's overseas production rose for the tenth month in a row due to steadily expanding production at its Kentucky plant and its unit in Thailand.  </p>
<p>Toyota's domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in June, with year-earlier percentage changes, were as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  306,232  up   10.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		254,386  up   13.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     51,846  down  0.7 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales    164,768  down  6.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		104,649  down 10.5 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     60,119  up    2.6 percent</p>
<p> Exports	     140,128  up   22.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		112,013  up   29.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     28,115  up    0.8 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output   117,794  up    6.6 percent</p>
<p>The breakdown for the Jan-June period was:</p>
<p> Production	1,833,510  up    9.7 percent</p>
<p>  - Car	    1,525,850  up   12.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus    307,660  down  3.8 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales  1,066,181  up    3.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		698,818  up    0.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus    367,363  up    7.5 percent</p>
<p> Exports	     703,458  up   12.4 percent</p>
<p>  - Car		538,231  up   14.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus    165,227  up    7.2 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output   742,694  up    9.2 percent</p>
